{"title":"CUE TIPS","description":null,"products":[{"product_id":"caiden","title":"Caiden Warrior \u0026 Fighter","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eCaiden Warrior Cue Tip\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eCaiden Warrior Cue Tip\u003c\/strong\u003e is designed to deliver dependable performance, excellent cue ball control, and consistent playability. Constructed from premium multi-layer leather, it provides a solid, responsive hit with enhanced chalk retention to help minimize miscues and maximize shot accuracy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEngineered for durability and consistency, the Caiden Warrior maintains its shape through extended play, making it an excellent choice for players seeking reliable performance at an exceptional value. Available in multiple hardness options to suit every playing style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium multi-layer leather construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExcellent chalk retention for improved grip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConsistent feel and reliable cue ball control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable design with long-lasting shape retention\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReduces miscues for greater confidence on every shot\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in \u003cstrong\u003eSuper Soft (SS), Soft (S), Medium (M), and Hard (H)\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e14mm diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c\/strong\u003e Recreational, league, and competitive players looking for a durable, high-performance cue tip that offers excellent control, consistency, and value.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Hard","offer_id":43442232426544,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true},{"title":"Medium","offer_id":43442232459312,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true},{"title":"Soft","offer_id":43442232492080,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/1b0b28b5-ca6b-4544-a6d8-01120f4ee9a3.png?v=1786676226"},{"product_id":"taom-pro","title":"Taom Pro","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eTaom Pro Cue Tip\u003c\/strong\u003e is designed for players who value precision, consistency, and a clean, controlled hit. Crafted from premium multi-layer leather, it delivers exceptional cue ball control, excellent chalk retention, and a consistent feel throughout its lifespan.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEngineered for long-lasting performance, the Taom Pro maintains its shape and firmness over extended play, helping reduce miscues while providing the confidence needed for accurate position play and spin. Whether you're competing in tournaments or enjoying league matches, the Taom Pro offers the reliability trusted by serious players.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium multi-layer leather construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExcellent chalk retention for consistent performance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrecise cue ball control and enhanced spin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable design with superior shape retention\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConsistent feel from the first shot to the last\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReduces miscues for improved shot confidence\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in \u003cstrong\u003eSoft (S), Medium (M), and Hard (H)\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e14mm diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c\/strong\u003e League, competitive, and professional players looking for a premium cue tip that delivers reliable performance, excellent control, and long-lasting durability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Hard","offer_id":43442236981296,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true},{"title":"Medium","offer_id":43442237014064,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true},{"title":"Soft","offer_id":43442237046832,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul29_2026_07_53_02PM.png?v=1785326039"},{"product_id":"kamui-athlete","title":"Kamui Athlete","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eKamui Athlete Cue Tip\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eKamui Athlete Cue Tip\u003c\/strong\u003e is engineered for players who demand precision, consistency, and confidence under pressure. Developed with Kamui's advanced leather technology, the Athlete series delivers exceptional cue ball control, reliable feedback, and long-lasting performance for today's competitive game.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned to maintain its shape while providing excellent chalk retention, the Kamui Athlete minimizes miscues and offers a consistent hit throughout its lifespan. Whether you're executing powerful break shots or precise positional play, this tip provides the control and responsiveness needed to perform at your best.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium multi-layer leather construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutstanding chalk retention for enhanced grip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConsistent hit with excellent cue ball control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable design with superior shape retention\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReduces miscues for greater shot confidence\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in \u003cstrong\u003eSoft (S), Medium (M), and Hard (H)\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e14mm diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIdeal for recreational, league, and professional players\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c\/strong\u003e Players seeking a premium cue tip that delivers exceptional consistency, precision, and dependable performance in every match.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Hard","offer_id":43442245664816,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true},{"title":"Medium","offer_id":43442245697584,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul29_2026_08_15_52PM.png?v=1785327366"},{"product_id":"taom-fusion-cue-tip","title":"Taom Fusion Cue Tip","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTaom Fusion Cue Tip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is engineered for players who want a powerful, precise, and responsive hit without sacrificing touch and control. Its unique hybrid construction combines a \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ehardened center with softer, more elastic edges\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, creating a balanced response that delivers efficient power transfer while maintaining excellent feel around the cue ball.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConstructed from \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e7 layers of high-quality pigskin leather\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, the Fusion is designed to provide consistent energy transfer and a controlled, confident response across a wide range of shots. The firmer center supports powerful cue-ball action, while the softer outer edges help deliver the touch and control needed for precise positional play.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeatures\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e7-layer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e premium pigskin leather construction\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHardened center for efficient power transmission\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSofter, more elastic edges for enhanced control and feel\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBalanced combination of power, precision, and responsiveness\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned for consistent performance across different shot types\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e14mm diameter\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e for pool cues\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAdvanced hybrid construction by Taom\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFirm, controlled playing response\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerfect For\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlayers looking for a premium cue tip that combines \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epower and control in one design\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. The Taom Fusion delivers a confident, responsive hit—from delicate positional shots to powerful cue-ball actions.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePower when you need it. Touch when it matters. The Taom Fusion delivers both.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43487076220976,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/s-l1200.jpg?v=1786676292"},{"product_id":"naolly-crest-cue-tip","title":"Naolly CREST Cue Tip","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNaolly CREST Cue Tip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a premium Japanese-made cue tip crafted from carefully selected \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eblack pigskin leather\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Its advanced \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e10-layer laminated construction\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is engineered to deliver a refined balance of flexibility, elasticity, resilience, and grip, giving players a consistent and controlled connection with the cue ball.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEach leather layer undergoes a \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ecore-dyeing process\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e to promote more uniform characteristics throughout the material, while Naolly's proprietary bonding technology helps maintain the integrity and stability of the laminated structure. The result is a cue tip designed for dependable response, precise cue ball control, and consistent feedback from shot to shot.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeatures\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003ePremium \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eJapanese black pigskin leather\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eAdvanced \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e10-layer laminated construction\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCore-dyed leather for more uniform characteristics\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eProprietary bonding technology between leather layers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExcellent chalk adhesion and cue ball grip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eControlled spin with responsive feedback\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBalanced flexibility, elasticity, and resilience\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStable and consistent impact response\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eApproximately \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e14mm diameter\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eApproximately \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e6.6–7mm thickness\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eAvailable in \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSoft (S), Medium (M), and Hard (H)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHardness Options\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCREST S — Soft\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned for players who prefer enhanced touch, sensitivity, and spin.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCREST M — Medium\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA balanced option offering an excellent combination of control, feel, and power.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCREST H — Hard\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eProvides a firmer, more direct hit with crisp feedback and efficient energy transfer.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerfect For\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlayers looking for a premium cue tip that combines \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eprecise control, excellent grip, responsive feedback, and consistent performance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e in a carefully engineered 10-layer Japanese pigskin construction.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e10 layers. Refined response. Consistent control. The Naolly CREST is engineered for players who demand precision from every shot.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43487146606640,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/p56303.jpg?v=1786676670"}],"url":"https:\/\/www.elitecue.shop\/collections\/cue-tips.oembed","provider":"Elite Cue","version":"1.0","type":"link"}